@Itisovtsy.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5209

### Проверка API и базы данных
GET {{Itisovtsy.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Регистрация пользователя
POST {{Itisovtsy.API_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Алексей Смирнов",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "ExamplePass123!",
  "confirmation": "ExamplePass123!"
}

### OpenAPI
GET {{Itisovtsy.API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
